{"ticker":"AEE","updated":"2026-10-30T22:32:39Z","profile":{"longName":"Ameren Corporation","shortName":"Ameren Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.amereninvestors.com","fullTimeEmployees":8913,"marketCap":30602254336,"trailingPE":19.461267,"forwardPE":19.045486,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.638361,"pegRatio":2.72,"targetMeanPrice":115.06111,"targetHighPrice":126.0,"targetLowPrice":104.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.062,"earningsGrowth":0.119,"grossMargins":0.52408004,"operatingMargins":0.25236,"profitMargins":0.18583,"totalRevenue":8410999808,"beta":0.451,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":118.32,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":96.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.72},"summary":"Ameren Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a public utility holding company in the United States. The company operates through four segments: Ameren Missouri, Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution, Ameren Illinois Natural Gas, and Ameren Transmission. It engages in the rate-regulated electric generation, transmission, and distribution business and natural gas transmission and distribution business. The company also generates electricity through coal, nuclear, and natural gas, as well as renewable energy, including hydroelectric, wind, methane gas, and solar energy centers. It serves residential, commercial, and industrial customers. Ameren Corporation was founded in 1881 and is headquartered in Saint Louis, Missouri.","summary_zh":"Ameren Corporation 及其子公司在美國以公用事業控股公司身分營運。該公司透過四個部門運營：Ameren 密蘇裡州、Ameren 伊利諾伊州電力分配部門、Ameren 伊利諾伊州天然氣部門和 Ameren 輸電部門。從事費率發電、輸配電業務及天然氣輸配電業務。該公司還透過煤炭、核能和天然氣以及再生能源（包括水力發電、風能、甲烷氣體和太陽能中心）發電。它為住宅、商業和工業客戶提供服務。 Ameren Corporation 成立於 1881 年，總部位於密蘇裡州聖路易斯。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":99.63,"h":99.94,"l":99.01,"c":99.72,"v":1639800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o